# SpecOps is a methodology repo — there is no build output to ignore.
# What follows guards the two things that leak from a real adopting repo,
# plus the usual local noise.

# Secrets and runtime scratch (these names are load-bearing in the method —
# see method/06-isolation.md. Anyone copying templates/ into their own repo
# should copy these ignore rules too.)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.run/
runs/
evidence/

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Local tooling
node_modules/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.log
